Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 06:09:12 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 09/11] soc: sprd: standardize SY108 peripheral and remoteproc
 lifecycles

Use standard remoteproc, NVMEM, watchdog and peripheral lifecycles.
Prepare firmware outside the kernel and start PM_SYS after its SIPC
receiver is installed. Retire the replaced private loaders and unused
serial function without adding independent modem hot reset.
